  "_note": "Weapon styles. Clips are Mixamo animations retargeted onto the base body (assets/anims, data/anim_sources.json). loco: the clip prefix whose idle / walk / run / strafe / back loops are picked by their measured travel direction. light: the combo (each press chains into the next inside the window); heavy: hold the attack button; special: the second attack (E). Each move: clip, speed (playback), dmg (x Attack Damage), poise (stagger damage), stamina, reach (m: the distance between the two bodies' centres the blow is thrown from - you step in to it while winding up). The swing's active window is measured from the clip (fastest blade-hand motion). Player hits are tuned as a power fantasy: light hits never interrupt your attacks; only heavy hits stagger you.",
